{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Prague, October 8.\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI left the city this afternoon and traveled through bright, sunlit Bohemia. The villages lay in the light, and as night fell, the full moon stood in the sky – a sight that reminded me of our shared hours in Berlin. I have resolved to be in Töplitz by noon tomorrow to enjoy the baths there. From there, I will continue my journey to Dresden; perhaps I will not reach the city on the Elbe until Sunday.\n\nThe air is fresh, and I feel lively. Please give my regards to the boys and tell Ludwig that I will soon be back in Berlin to tell him the stories of my journey. I often think of you and our quiet evenings.\n\nYour faithful\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221150,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":166,"prompt_tokens":261,"total_tokens":427,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-eangmW0olxOh5pFxST4g8qotzKXlUGFp","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":261,"prompt_ms":392.497,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.5038199233716476,"prompt_per_second":664.9732354642201,"predicted_n":166,"predicted_ms":3853.538,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.35477575757576,"predicted_per_second":42.81779497178956}}